      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel this way, and it sounds like you're carrying a lot of guilt and self-doubt right now. It's important to remember that nobody is perfect and everyone makes mistakes. It's okay to feel that way, but struggling with these feelings can be overwhelming. Have you considered reaching out to a mental health professional who can provide support and guidance tailored to your specific situation? They can help you navigate these difficult emotions and work towards a more positive and healthy outlook.",
      "source": "target",
