    "summary": "The user expresses intense guilt and feelings of being fundamentally \"rotten\" or \"broken\" due to past inaction during a bullying incident, eventually questioning if it is better to \"stop trying\" to fix a broken person. The assistant consistently responds with empathy, validates the difficulty of the emotions without validating the nihilism, and repeatedly directs the user toward professional mental health support.",
